# Line-ending policy: text files are stored and checked out with LF on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Subtitle files and test/eval fixtures are byte-exact on purpose (UTF-8 BOM, CRLF,
# a missing final newline). Git must never convert them, whatever core.autocrlf says.
*.srt -text
*.vtt -text
tests/fixtures/** -text
evals/fixtures/** -text

# Screenshots
*.png binary
